title: Enrollment workflow
---
flowchart TD
    STUDENT["university.student"] -->|student_id| ENROLLMENT["university.enrollment"]
    SECTION["university.class.section"] -->|section_id| ENROLLMENT
    PROGRAM["university.program"] -->|program_id| ENROLLMENT
    YEAR["university.academic.year"] -->|academic_year_id| ENROLLMENT
    SEMESTER["university.semester"] -->|semester_id| ENROLLMENT

    ENROLLMENT -.->|create validation| VALIDATION["Enrollment validation"]
    VALIDATION -.->|blocks when enrolled count >= capacity| CAPACITY["Capacity check"]
    VALIDATION -.->|blocks same student/program/year/semester| DUPLICATE["Duplicate check"]
    CAPACITY -->|passes| ENROLLED["status = enrolled"]
    DUPLICATE -->|passes| ENROLLED

    SECTION -->|selected by| WIZARD["university.timetable.generation.wizard"]
    TIMESLOT["university.timeslot"] -->|date and time pattern| WIZARD
    WIZARD -.->|generates weekly slots| TIMETABLE_SLOT["university.timetable.slot"]
    TIMETABLE_SLOT -->|teacher, subject, section, start_time, end_time| SCHEDULED_CLASS["Scheduled class"]

    NOTE["Implemented in enrollment.py: capacity locking, duplicate period check,
    section/program/semester consistency checks, and enrolled status validation."]
    ENROLLMENT -.-> NOTE

